{
  "entries": [
    {"key": "TEMP_COMMENT_1", "value": "Intro NPC dialogue below"},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_1", "value": "Authorized personnel only...\nGreen?"},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_2", "value": "So you're one of those, huh?"},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_3", "value": "See the <i>window</i> here?"},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_4", "value": "...\nGreen goggles can't see the map. That's just how it is."},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_5", "value": "Why?\nSo you can't run away, obviously!"},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_6", "value": "...Will you be free once you finish eliminating the targets?\nMaybe. Probably."},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_7", "value": "But then what?\nAnother <i>new mission?</i>"},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_8", "value": "But there's another option.\nTa-da, red goggles!"},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_9", "value": "See the places you can't!\nOnly 99900 credits!"},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_10", "value": "Why red?\nBecause you're green."},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_11", "value": "...Wait, you seriously don't know?\nFine, the explanation's on the house."},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_12", "value": "You know the three primary colors of light, right?\nRed, blue, green."},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_13", "value": "Your color decides what you can see.\nYour goggles hold you back."},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_14", "value": "Red goggles, for example...\nlet you see outside. Through the windows."},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_15", "value": "Blue can see <i>people</i>.\nPeople, not machines."},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_16", "value": "And green, like you..."},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_17", "value": "...can see <i>us</i>."},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_18", "value": "Works for me. I don't get many people to talk to,"},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_19", "value": "and it's been a while since I had a sucker... oops,\nI mean, a customer!"},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_20", "value": "Anyway, think about it.\nWill you keep listening to Orbis"},
    {"key": "DLG_INTRO_NPC_21", "value": "or...\nbecome truly <i>free</i>?"},

    {"key": "TEMP_COMMENT_2", "value": "Shopkeeper dialogue below"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_1", "value": "A familiar terminal..."},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_2", "value": "“Wanna trade?”"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_3", "value": "“Take your pick.”"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_3_1", "value": "“{0}? You buying?”"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_3_2", "value": "“{0}? You buying?”"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_3_3", "value": "“{0}? You buying?”"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_SOLD_OUT", "value": "“That one's already sold.”"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_4_SUCCESS", "value": "“Deal! Thanks~”"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_4_FAIL", "value": "“...\nYou don't have enough credits!”"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_5", "value": "<i>Really?</i>"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_6_SUCCESS", "value": "Obtained an item!"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_6_FAIL", "value": "...! You cut your fingertip."},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_7", "value": "You feel like you've done\nsomething terribly wrong."},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_8", "value": "“...”"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_9", "value": "The terminal\nshut down."},

    {"key": "TEMP_COMMENT_3", "value": "Shop dialogue option text below"},
    {"key": "OPT_STORE_NPC_2_1", "value": "Yes"},
    {"key": "OPT_STORE_NPC_2_2", "value": "No"},
    {"key": "OPT_STORE_NPC_2_3", "value": "...Attempt hack"},
    {"key": "OPT_STORE_NPC_3_1", "value": "Item 1 - 100"},
    {"key": "OPT_STORE_NPC_3_2", "value": "Item 2 - 200"},
    {"key": "OPT_STORE_NPC_3_3", "value": "Item 3 - 300"},
    {"key": "OPT_STORE_NPC_3_1_1", "value": "Yes"},
    {"key": "OPT_STORE_NPC_3_1_2", "value": "No"},
    {"key": "OPT_STORE_ITEM_LABEL", "value": "{0} - {1}"},
    {"key": "OPT_STORE_ITEM_SOLD_OUT", "value": "Sold Out"},

    {"key": "TEMP_COMMENT_3_1", "value": "Shop 2 (revisit) NPC dialogue below"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_NO_HACK_LEAVE", "value": "“The Mother Core's next.\nHang in there.”"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_HACK_WARN", "value": "“Don't do that again.”"},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_DEAD_REVISIT_1", "value": "The terminal is powered off..."},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_DEAD_REVISIT_2", "value": "It doesn't look like it'll ever turn on again."},
    {"key": "DLG_STORE_NPC_AGAIN", "value": "“Another trade?”"},

    {"key": "TEMP_COMMENT_4", "value": "Event A NPC dialogue below"},
    {"key": "DLG_EVENT_NPC_A_1", "value": "A broken maintenance pod.\n...It seems to still be running."},
    {"key": "DLG_EVENT_NPC_A_1_0", "value": "What will you do?"},
    {"key": "DLG_EVENT_NPC_A_1_1", "value": "After the maintenance,\nyou feel somewhat better."},
    {"key": "DLG_EVENT_NPC_A_2", "value": "...Looks like the safety lock\nneeds to be disabled."},
    {"key": "DLG_EVENT_NPC_A_2_1", "value": "You broke safety protocol,\nbut something feels improved."},
    {"key": "DLG_EVENT_NPC_A_4", "value": "...! There were credits\ninside the pod."},
    {"key": "DLG_EVENT_NPC_A_5", "value": "A maintenance pod that's stopped working."},
    {"key": "OPT_EVENT_NPC_A_1_1", "value": "Run Maintenance"},
    {"key": "OPT_EVENT_NPC_A_1_2", "value": "Force Start"},
    {"key": "OPT_EVENT_NPC_A_1_3", "value": "Dismantle Pod"},
    {"key": "OPT_EVENT_NPC_A_2_1", "value": "Disable it."},
    {"key": "OPT_EVENT_NPC_A_2_2", "value": "Leave it."},

    {"key": "TEMP_COMMENT_5", "value": "Event B NPC dialogue below"},
    {"key": "DLG_EVENT_NPC_B_1", "value": "...\nWhat will you do?"},
    {"key": "DLG_EVENT_NPC_B_1_1", "value": "..!\nA new ability has been added."},
    {"key": "DLG_EVENT_NPC_B_1_2", "value": "With the protocol taken,\nyou feel... stronger, somehow."},
    {"key": "DLG_EVENT_NPC_B_1_3", "value": "...\nYou feel more at peace."},
    {"key": "OPT_EVENT_NPC_B_1_1", "value": "Take the card"},
    {"key": "OPT_EVENT_NPC_B_1_2", "value": "Take the protocol"},
    {"key": "OPT_EVENT_NPC_B_1_3", "value": "...(Moment of silence)"},
    {"key": "DLG_EVENT_NPC_B_2", "value": "..."},

    {"key": "TEMP_COMMENT_6", "value": "Ending NPC dialogue below"},
    {"key": "DLG_END_NPC_1", "value": "I was just like you. Orbis's obedient dog.\n...Until I learned the <i>truth</i>."},
    {"key": "DLG_END_NPC_2", "value": "<i>Z.</i> Think about what it means to act for yourself."}
  ]
}